{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026C2ohTZ9DpA1795172671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>馬鞍山富寶花園有內部私人供水管爆裂，屋苑食水及沖廁水供應受影響。</p><p></p><p>傍晚約六時晚飯時間，不少居民帶同水桶、水袋等，到樓下水車取水，取水點出現人龍，有水務署「供水特攻隊」及關愛隊成員協助居民。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GX5CN5F49Z1795172699.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水務署指早上得悉，富寶花園有內部私人供水管爆裂，與沙田民政處、區議員等協調後，已安排臨時食水供應。除了4架水車，亦放置了24個水箱。水務署指大廈管理處承建商正安排緊急維修，署方會提供適切技術支援，以盡快完成維修工程。</p><p></p><p>富寶花園屬私人參建居屋，共有12座、超過4,000個單位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.224279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:57:16.410877+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:18.706192+00:00","content_hash":"a27339ef41c9654f8b2fb55ccc08fdac434ebd077db7199974e8726e56817dfe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.224279+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}